"""English replacements for ARTEX code-owned Chinese prompt fragments.

These strings are NOT editable in the UI: Go appends them to the system prompt
after the DB body (see agent/worker.go, planner.go, wrapup.go, ...). Translating
only agent_prompts would still leave Chinese in every agent <-> LLM message.

Each entry is (sha1[:12] of the DECODED upstream Go string literal, English text).
apply_en.py hashes every Chinese-bearing Go string literal and swaps the whole
literal, so upstream line moves / insertions cannot desynchronise this table.
An upstream wording change produces an unmatched hash -> a loud warning, never
a silent Chinese prompt. Whitespace and %s/%d are preserved deliberately.
"""

